"P231196099" "Have you ever heard of the Syndicate, shuga'? It wouldn't surprise me if you hadn't. They're a mysterious organization of extra special scum. Something about those clowns keeps them out of sight and mind of the Seers, and that means they can make a mess of things in a hurry if the PPD aren't around to spot 'em.<br><br>It just so happens that a PPD officer reported sighting a few Syndicate go-gangers around Elysium Avenue. I want you to go find 'em, question 'em, and stop whatever it is they're up to. Can I count on you?"
